<title>POLAND: Irena revises up 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Irena revises up 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irena results for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.20 vs     4.37</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   9.62 vs     9.88</p>
<p>    net profit				 6.74 vs     7.07</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Huta Szkla Gospodarczego Irena SA. Earlier the firm reported net profit at 1.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				 60.77 vs   51.37</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  46.10 vs   38.64</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.45 vs    0.07 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.87 vs    2.81</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    77.04 vs   70.44</p>
<p>    financial costs			 73.13 vs   64.92</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
